    "This tape covers the 2026 Hungarian Darts Trophy (ET11, MVM Dome, Budapest, 28–30 August 2026). First round 28 Aug (best of 11), second round 29 Aug (best of 11), third round / quarter-finals / semi-finals / final 30 Aug (best of 11 / 11 / 13 / 15).",
